  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin del Sistema de Administracin Financiera Pblica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of the Public Financial Administration System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Objetivo general es apoyar el desarrollo e implantacin del nuevo Sistema Integrado de Administracin Financiera  SIAF II, con el propsito de mejorar la eficiencia y transparencia en la gestin del gasto pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to help make public management more efficient by modernizing financial management in the public sector through the development and introduction of tools and systems for programming, executing, and reporting on income, expenditures, and public financing, that are integrated and aligned with a measurement of outputs and outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
